    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1492">

                <pb facs="0965" n="849" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg849"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.41/108.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Agent Carothers to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">El Paso</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-02-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 23, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I to-day received following from Villa regarding delivery of Benton’s body:
                        <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Very sorry can not deliver Benton’s body at present time. When time comes
                            to do it, I will comply with my obligations, and will give an account of
                            my proceedings to the whole world.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>I immediately telegraphed him text your telegram, and reiterated my request.
                    Expect reply in morning.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">G. C. Carothers</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
